%% alt: The three risky capabilities: A, untrusted input such as web pages, email, uploads or retrieved documents; B, access to sensitive data or systems; C, the ability to change state or communicate out. Any two together carry lower risk. All three in one session mean an injected instruction can steal data or act.
flowchart TB
  A[A: untrusted input<br/>web, email, uploads,<br/>retrieved docs]:::untrusted
  B[B: sensitive data<br/>or systems]:::data
  C[C: change state or<br/>communicate out]:::tool
  A & B & C --> X[A + B + C in one session:<br/>an injection can steal or act.<br/>Any two together: lower risk]:::untrusted
